    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.7287902832031,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This chapter presents the ﬁve questions identiﬁed by the steering group as essential for",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.564205169677734,
        72.27304077148438,
        399.7737121582031,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "formulating recommendations. The summary results of the systematic reviews are also",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.60920333862305,
        84.27005004882812,
        83.523193359375,
        93.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "presented.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.60920333862305,
        114.09635925292969,
        176.63720703125,
        123.09635925292969
      ],
      "text": "2.2 MAIN QUESTIONS ADDRESSED",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.61820602416992,
        132.26705932617188,
        256.72808837890625,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "The steering committee agreed on ﬁve main questions:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.61820602416992,
        150.26705932617188,
        399.64813232421875,
        159.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "1. In what proportion of contacts of new or recurrent cases (index cases) of TB does contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.11420822143555,
        162.26406860351562,
        304.02398681640625,
        171.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "investigation lead to identiﬁcation of previously undiagnosed TB?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02499771118164,
        180.27603149414062,
        319.6389465332031,
        189.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Outcome: Percentage of contacts evaluated who are found to have TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53799819946289,
        198.27603149414062,
        399.7660827636719,
        207.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "2. Who should be considered an index case for the purposes of initiating contact investigation?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.10599899291992,
        216.27603149414062,
        367.6719055175781,
        225.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Outcome: Characteristics of patients who are most likely to transmit the infection",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.61899948120117,
        234.27603149414062,
        274.14404296875,
        243.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "3. How can the contacts at greatest risk for TB be identiﬁed?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.132999420166016,
        252.27603149414062,
        369.1173400878906,
        261.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Outcome: Characteristics of contacts who have the highest likelihood of having TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5254020690918,
        270.27606201171875,
        399.870361328125,
        279.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "4. In what proportion of contacts of an index case with HIV infection does contact investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.2014045715332,
        282.2730712890625,
        251.4334716796875,
        291.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "lead to identiﬁcation of previously undiagnosed TB?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.2014045715332,
        300.2730712890625,
        319.81536865234375,
        309.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "Outcome: Percentage of contacts evaluated who are found to have TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.71440505981445,
        318.2730712890625,
        399.7710266113281,
        327.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "5. In what proportion of contacts of an index case with MDR-TB or XDR-TB does contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.23740768432617,
        330.27008056640625,
        304.24542236328125,
        339.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "investigation lead to identiﬁcation of previously undiagnosed TB?",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.24641036987305,
        348.27008056640625,
        319.63177490234375,
        357.2790832519531
      ],
      "text": "Outcome: Percentage of contacts evaluated who are found to have TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53080368041992,
        378.10223388671875,
        141.92678833007812,
        387.10223388671875
      ],
      "text": "2.3 SYSTEMATIC REVIEWS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5398063659668,
        396.27294921875,
        399.6867370605469,
        405.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "The ﬁve questions speciﬁed above were addressed in two systematic reviews. These reviews",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5128059387207,
        408.26995849609375,
        400.1006164550781,
        417.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "undertaken by Fox G et al. (8) and by Fair E et al. (summary available at online Annex 4:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.46780776977539,
        420.2669677734375,
        399.8035888671875,
        429.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "http://www.who.int/tb/Systematicreviewcontact_investigation.pdf), updating the review by",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.62080764770508,
        432.26397705078125,
        400.0664978027344,
        441.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "Morrison et al. (7), are summarized in annexes 1 and 2. The two reviews had similar ﬁndings.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52358627319336,
        444.2729187011719,
        399.6884765625,
        453.2729187011719
      ],
      "text": "Inclusion of studies in the systematic review by Fox et al. is illustrated in Figure 1. For the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52358627319336,
        456.2699279785156,
        399.6700744628906,
        465.2699279785156
      ],
      "text": "purposes of the recommendations, only studies conducted in low- and middle-income countries",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.496585845947266,
        468.2669372558594,
        150.98260498046875,
        477.2669372558594
      ],
      "text": "were included in the review.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.76060485839844,
        651.97265625,
        224.4506072998047,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "18",
